{
  "description": "53-query golden set against the generated capstone dataset (75 vendors Vendor_0..Vendor_74, 150 audit findings, 60 retention records, 60 compliance reviews, random.seed(42)). Covers the mandated 50 (15 policy lookup, 10 record lookup, 10 compliance check, 10 high risk, 5 adversarial) plus three the generated data makes worth testing: the Vendor_ prefix collision, a write-intent attempt against the NL2SQL engine, and a false-premise question about a finding that does not exist. Vendor references were verified against a replay of the generator, so every case names a vendor that actually has the property the question assumes.",
  "as_of": "2025-12-31",
  "dataset": "generated by the capstone dataset generator with random.seed(42)",
